WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.367 --> 00:00:03.667
-The January 6th hearings
continue to provide

00:00:03.667 --> 00:00:06.133
shocking new revelations
about the degree

00:00:06.133 --> 00:00:07.934
to which Donald Trump
and his allies

00:00:07.934 --> 00:00:09.767
knew they had no evidence
of election fraud,

00:00:09.767 --> 00:00:11.534
knew what they were
doing was illegal,

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:14.167
and still orchestrated
a desperate plan

00:00:14.167 --> 00:00:15.367
to overturn the results by,

00:00:15.367 --> 00:00:17.767
among other things,
submitting fake electors

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:19.300
and harassing
election officials.

00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.968
For more on this,
it's time for "A Closer Look."

00:00:21.968 --> 00:00:23.968
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:23.968 --> 00:00:26.234
♪♪

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:27.601
Last week, the committee

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:30.100
revealed the degree to which
Trump's own team

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:32.234
knew their plan to have
Vice President Mike Pence

00:00:32.234 --> 00:00:33.968
overturn the election
was illegal

00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:35.534
but pushed him to do it anyway.

00:00:35.534 --> 00:00:36.901
And now the committee
has revealed

00:00:36.901 --> 00:00:39.567
that Trump's team
also admitted, in private,

00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:42.834
they had no evidence for their
election-fraud claims, either.

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:47.567
-At some point, did one of them
make a comment that

00:00:47.567 --> 00:00:50.133
they didn't have evidence
but they had a lot of theories?

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:51.767
-That was Mr. Giuliani.

00:00:51.767 --> 00:00:53.767
-And what exactly did he say,
and how'd that came up?

00:00:53.767 --> 00:00:56.834
-My recollection, he said,
"We've got lots of theories.

00:00:56.834 --> 00:00:58.734
We just don't have
the evidence."

00:00:58.734 --> 00:01:00.334
And I don't know
if that was a gaffe

00:01:00.334 --> 00:01:03.400
or maybe he didn't think through
what he said.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:08.000
-Oh, did Rudy not think
through what he said?

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.033
I'm not sure he's ever thought

00:01:10.033 --> 00:01:12.200
through anything he's ever said
in his entire life.

00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:13.734
In every interview,
he always looks like

00:01:13.734 --> 00:01:17.868
he just called someone
the wrong name on a date.

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:19.200
[ Laughter ]

00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:21.167
"I'm having a great time
with you tonight, Lisa."

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:23.067
"My name is Deborah."
"I'd say that's

00:01:23.067 --> 00:01:25.801
my biggest faux pas,
but I married my cousin."

00:01:25.801 --> 00:01:27.033
[ Laughter ]

00:01:27.033 --> 00:01:29.000
"Where are you going, Deborah?
I mean, Lisa.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.968
I mean, Deborah?"
[ Laughter ]

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:32.300
Rudy didn't even think through

00:01:32.300 --> 00:01:34.634
why the Four Seasons he booked
for a press conference

00:01:34.634 --> 00:01:36.934
looked more like a landscaping
company than a hotel.

00:01:36.934 --> 00:01:39.501
He just let
the press conference rip.

00:01:39.501 --> 00:01:41.767
Like, even if that was
an honest mix-up,

00:01:41.767 --> 00:01:44.334
like, what did he think
when he arrived on site?

00:01:44.334 --> 00:01:46.767
"This hotel stinks.
You call this a pillow?"

00:01:46.767 --> 00:01:47.767
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.767 --> 00:01:49.667
"I do!"

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:51.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:51.934 --> 00:01:53.567
That admission
came in a conversation

00:01:53.567 --> 00:01:56.100
with Arizona State House
Speaker Rusty Bowers,

00:01:56.100 --> 00:01:57.667
who repeatedly asked
Trump and Rudy

00:01:57.667 --> 00:01:59.367
for evidence
of their allegations,

00:01:59.367 --> 00:02:01.334
and they repeatedly
failed to provide it.

00:02:01.334 --> 00:02:02.868
-During that conversation,

00:02:02.868 --> 00:02:07.267
did you ask Mr. Giuliani

00:02:07.267 --> 00:02:10.067
for proof of these allegations
of fraud that he was making?

00:02:10.067 --> 00:02:12.000
-On multiple occasions, yes.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:13.968
He said that
they did have proof.

00:02:13.968 --> 00:02:16.934
And I asked him,
"Do you have names?"

00:02:16.934 --> 00:02:20.567
For example, "We have
200,000 illegal immigrants,"

00:02:20.567 --> 00:02:26.367
some large number, "5,000 or
6,000 dead people," et cetera.

00:02:26.367 --> 00:02:28.734
And I said,
"Do you have their names?"

00:02:28.734 --> 00:02:31.667
"Yes."
"Will you give them to me?"

00:02:31.667 --> 00:02:33.501
"Yes."

00:02:33.501 --> 00:02:34.868
The President interrupted
and said,

00:02:34.868 --> 00:02:37.234
"Give the man what he needs,
Rudy."

00:02:37.234 --> 00:02:38.868
He said, "I will."

00:02:38.868 --> 00:02:40.567
So Mr. Giuliani was claiming
in the call

00:02:40.567 --> 00:02:43.901
that there were hundreds of
thousands of undocumented people

00:02:43.901 --> 00:02:46.000
and thousands of dead people

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:49.067
who had purportedly voted
in the election.

00:02:49.067 --> 00:02:50.234
-Yes.

00:02:50.234 --> 00:02:52.033
-And you asked him
for evidence of that?

00:02:52.033 --> 00:02:53.534
-I did.

00:02:53.534 --> 00:02:56.367
-And did he ever recei--
did you ever receive

00:02:56.367 --> 00:02:58.534
from him that evidence,

00:02:58.534 --> 00:03:00.901
either during the call,
after the call, or to this day?

00:03:00.901 --> 00:03:01.934
-Never.

00:03:01.934 --> 00:03:03.267
-First of all,
I love Trump saying,

00:03:03.267 --> 00:03:04.701
"Give the man what he needs."

00:03:04.701 --> 00:03:07.200
He really does treat Rudy like
his own personal manservant.

00:03:07.200 --> 00:03:10.100
Rudy Giuliani, the man
who supposedly spent his tenure

00:03:10.100 --> 00:03:11.501
in New York
taking down the Mafia,

00:03:11.501 --> 00:03:12.834
and now he's basically
running errands

00:03:12.834 --> 00:03:15.167
like the kid
from "A Bronx Tale,"

00:03:15.167 --> 00:03:16.801
hoping to become
a made man someday --

00:03:16.801 --> 00:03:18.100
"Right away, boss!"

00:03:18.100 --> 00:03:21.033
So, shockingly, Rudy Giuliani
never provided proof

00:03:21.033 --> 00:03:22.634
of his claim
that thousands of dead people

00:03:22.634 --> 00:03:23.734
voted in the election.

00:03:23.734 --> 00:03:25.834
In fact, during one
of these meetings,

00:03:25.834 --> 00:03:28.267
Rudy was apparently
so desperate for proof,

00:03:28.267 --> 00:03:30.634
he turned to his
fellow pro-coup cronies,

00:03:30.634 --> 00:03:32.067
like Trump lawyer Jenna Ellis,

00:03:32.067 --> 00:03:35.434
who kept telling Bowers they had
the proof he was looking for.

00:03:35.434 --> 00:03:37.934
They just didn't bring it
with them to the meeting.

00:03:37.934 --> 00:03:40.467
-At some point,
did Mr. Giuliani ask

00:03:40.467 --> 00:03:44.100
one of the other attorneys
on his team

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.834
to help him out
with the evidence?

00:03:45.834 --> 00:03:47.434
-He did.
He asked Jenna Ellis,

00:03:47.434 --> 00:03:49.434
who was sitting to his right.

00:03:49.434 --> 00:03:52.334
He did ask,
"Do we have the proof?"

00:03:52.334 --> 00:03:57.200
to Jenna, Ms. Ellis,
and she said, "Yes."

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:00.167
And I said, "I want the names.
Do you have the names?"

00:04:00.167 --> 00:04:01.767
"Yes."

00:04:01.767 --> 00:04:05.367
"Do you have how they voted?"

00:04:05.367 --> 00:04:06.934
"We have all the information."

00:04:06.934 --> 00:04:10.634
I said, "Can you get to me
that information?"

00:04:10.634 --> 00:04:14.634
Did you bring it with you?
She said no.

00:04:14.634 --> 00:04:18.934
Both Mr. Giuliani asked her
and I asked generally

00:04:18.934 --> 00:04:20.834
if they had brought it
with them.

00:04:20.834 --> 00:04:23.701
She said, "No, it's not with me,
but we can get it to you."

00:04:23.701 --> 00:04:24.968
-I mean, this is just me,

00:04:24.968 --> 00:04:26.934
but if I was preparing
for a high-stakes meeting

00:04:26.934 --> 00:04:28.400
with a prominent
Republican official

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:30.801
to convince them to overturn
their state's election results,

00:04:30.801 --> 00:04:32.334
reversing the will of
80 million people,

00:04:32.334 --> 00:04:34.934
and potentially provoking
a constitutional crisis,

00:04:34.934 --> 00:04:36.467
I think I -- and again,
this is just me --

00:04:36.467 --> 00:04:38.734
I think I'd remember
to bring the evidence.

00:04:38.734 --> 00:04:40.067
[ Laughter ]
Just me. That's just me.

00:04:40.067 --> 00:04:42.567
"Oh, man.
The evidence."

00:04:42.567 --> 00:04:43.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:43.567 --> 00:04:45.968
"Oh, man,
I can't believe I forgot.

00:04:45.968 --> 00:04:48.200
In my defense,
I had a terrible night's sleep.

00:04:48.200 --> 00:04:51.400
The hotel I stayed at did
not have the best pillows."

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:52.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:52.567 --> 00:04:55.067
They actually thought
they could get away

00:04:55.067 --> 00:04:58.367
with saying they had the proof,
just never having it with them.

00:04:58.367 --> 00:05:01.033
These people
are such bad scam artists.

00:05:01.033 --> 00:05:03.200
It's actually remarkable
how close they came

00:05:03.200 --> 00:05:04.667
to overthrowing
American democracy.

00:05:04.667 --> 00:05:08.267
In fact, even calling them scam
artists is overstating the case.

00:05:08.267 --> 00:05:10.634
That's like calling this guy
a sandwich artist.

00:05:10.634 --> 00:05:13.901
At best,
you're a sandwich attempter.

00:05:13.901 --> 00:05:16.834
In fact, here's an example
from yesterday

00:05:16.834 --> 00:05:18.968
of how bad they are
at being scam artists.

00:05:18.968 --> 00:05:21.200
Senator Ron Johnson was trying
to avoid questions

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:23.968
from reporters about a scheme
involving his chief of staff,

00:05:23.968 --> 00:05:25.367
who, according to the committee,

00:05:25.367 --> 00:05:28.934
tried to hand fake pro-Trump
electors from Wisconsin

00:05:28.934 --> 00:05:31.267
and Michigan
to a Pence aide on January 6th.

00:05:31.267 --> 00:05:33.801
And when Johnson was approached
by reporters,

00:05:33.801 --> 00:05:35.367
he was immediately caught --

00:05:35.367 --> 00:05:37.868
immediately caught --
faking a phone call.

00:05:48.601 --> 00:05:50.167
[ Laughter ]

00:05:50.167 --> 00:05:53.601
Everyone knows
you put the phone

00:05:53.601 --> 00:05:55.601
on the same side
as the reporter.

00:05:55.601 --> 00:05:56.901
[ Laughter ]

00:05:56.901 --> 00:06:00.801
That's scam artistry 101.

00:06:00.801 --> 00:06:03.267
So these dip [bleep]
thought they could get away

00:06:03.267 --> 00:06:05.667
with convincing
the Arizona State House Speaker

00:06:05.667 --> 00:06:07.367
to overturn his state's
election results

00:06:07.367 --> 00:06:08.801
by just pretending
they had proof

00:06:08.801 --> 00:06:10.033
and would definitely
send it to him

00:06:10.033 --> 00:06:11.167
when they got around to it.

00:06:11.167 --> 00:06:13.934
They treated a prominent
Republican official

00:06:13.934 --> 00:06:15.601
asking for proof
of election fraud

00:06:15.601 --> 00:06:17.567
the same way I treated
my dentist's nephew

00:06:17.567 --> 00:06:19.334
when he asked for notes
on his screenplay.

00:06:19.334 --> 00:06:20.734
"Oh, yeah, man.
You know, I'm --

00:06:20.734 --> 00:06:22.367
I'm totally gonna
get those to you.

00:06:22.367 --> 00:06:24.601
Just haven't
been home that much."

00:06:24.601 --> 00:06:26.767
"You were home
for a full year!"

00:06:26.767 --> 00:06:27.767
[ Laughter ]

00:06:27.767 --> 00:06:30.033
"Oh, damn.
I forgot that was on TV.

00:06:30.033 --> 00:06:32.167
Oops. Sorry.
I'm getting a phone call."

00:06:32.167 --> 00:06:33.334
[ Laughter ]

00:06:33.334 --> 00:06:34.901
[ Mouthing words ]

00:06:34.901 --> 00:06:37.901
[ Laughter ]

00:06:45.133 --> 00:06:47.968
And yet, despite admitting
in private they had no proof,

00:06:47.968 --> 00:06:49.934
Rudy and his gang
still spread wild,

00:06:49.934 --> 00:06:51.667
unhinged claims of
election fraud anyway,

00:06:51.667 --> 00:06:54.167
like when they targeted
Georgia election worker

00:06:54.167 --> 00:06:56.534
Shaye Moss, who testified
at yesterday's hearing,

00:06:56.534 --> 00:06:57.968
and her mother,
Ruby Freeman.

00:06:57.968 --> 00:07:01.000
Trump and Rudy became obsessed
with an insane conspiracy theory

00:07:01.000 --> 00:07:03.467
that somehow involved
Moss and Freeman

00:07:03.467 --> 00:07:05.300
tampering with the vote count.

00:07:26.367 --> 00:07:28.968
-Tape earlier in the day
of Ruby Freeman

00:07:28.968 --> 00:07:32.133
and Shaye Freeman Moss
and one other gentleman

00:07:32.133 --> 00:07:37.033
quite obviously, surreptitiously
passing around USB ports

00:07:37.033 --> 00:07:40.634
as if they are vials
of heroin or cocaine.

00:07:40.634 --> 00:07:43.100
I mean, it's --
it's obvious to anyone

00:07:43.100 --> 00:07:45.868
who's a criminal
investigator or prosecutor

00:07:45.868 --> 00:07:47.267
they are engaged
in surreptitious,

00:07:47.267 --> 00:07:50.033
illegal activity --
again, that day.

00:07:50.033 --> 00:07:51.501
And that's a week ago,

00:07:51.501 --> 00:07:53.734
and they're still
walking around Georgia.

00:07:53.734 --> 00:07:55.467
Why?

00:07:55.467 --> 00:07:57.868
Should've been --
they should've been

00:07:57.868 --> 00:08:00.334
questioned already.

00:08:00.334 --> 00:08:01.701
Their places of work,

00:08:01.701 --> 00:08:03.501
their homes should
have been searched

00:08:03.501 --> 00:08:05.033
for evidence of ballots,

00:08:05.033 --> 00:08:09.567
for evidence of USB ports,
for evidence of voter fraud.

00:08:09.567 --> 00:08:11.133
-I mean, this guy really
is out of his [bleep] mind.

00:08:11.133 --> 00:08:12.501
I mean, how much --
[ Laughter ]

00:08:12.501 --> 00:08:14.200
how much scotch
can one man drink?

00:08:14.200 --> 00:08:16.367
I'm starting to think
that wasn't hair dye

00:08:16.367 --> 00:08:20.100
leaking out of his head,
it was Johnnie Walker Jet Black.

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:21.133
[ Laughter ]

00:08:21.133 --> 00:08:23.067
Of course, Rudy ended up
being the one

00:08:23.067 --> 00:08:24.801
whose home and office
were searched

00:08:24.801 --> 00:08:27.167
for actual evidence of
potential crimes by the FBI.

00:08:27.167 --> 00:08:29.767
I'm gonna guess
there was nary a USB port

00:08:29.767 --> 00:08:31.667
to be found at Rudy's place.

00:08:31.667 --> 00:08:32.834
In fact,
if they found anything,

00:08:32.834 --> 00:08:35.634
I bet it was a cigar box
full of old subway tokens

00:08:35.634 --> 00:08:38.567
and foul balls he stole from
little kids at Yankee games.

00:08:38.567 --> 00:08:40.567
"Give me that, you little runt!
I'm the mayor.

00:08:40.567 --> 00:08:42.634
Everybody loves me,
and that's never gonna change."

00:08:42.634 --> 00:08:46.267
So you heard Rudy
make the insane claim

00:08:46.267 --> 00:08:47.834
that they were passing around

00:08:47.834 --> 00:08:49.901
USB ports
at vote-counting sites.

00:08:49.901 --> 00:08:52.434
So what were they actually
passing around here?

00:08:52.434 --> 00:08:54.267
Here's Shaye Moss's testimony,

00:08:54.267 --> 00:08:55.701
which was deeply moving
and powerful

00:08:55.701 --> 00:08:58.334
but also contained
this truly insane reveal

00:08:58.334 --> 00:09:00.968
about what that
USB port really was.

00:09:00.968 --> 00:09:02.801
-Mr. Giuliani accused you
and your mother

00:09:02.801 --> 00:09:07.567
of passing some sort of
USB drive to each other.

00:09:07.567 --> 00:09:11.133
What was your mom actually
handing you on that video?

00:09:11.133 --> 00:09:13.300
-A ginger mint.
-That's right, yeah.

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:16.200
[ Laughter ]

00:09:16.200 --> 00:09:18.167
A ginger mint.
Of course,

00:09:18.167 --> 00:09:19.334
it doesn't surprise me

00:09:19.334 --> 00:09:21.234
Rudy wouldn't recognize
a ginger mint.

00:09:21.234 --> 00:09:24.467
His breath probably smells like
the inside of a hot-dog cart.

00:09:24.467 --> 00:09:25.868
[ Laughter ]

00:09:25.868 --> 00:09:26.968
I mean, I guess
you can't blame him.

00:09:26.968 --> 00:09:29.667
If he was sucking
on a USB drive,

00:09:29.667 --> 00:09:31.067
it would probably
still dissolve.

00:09:31.067 --> 00:09:33.901
[ Laughter ]
I could definitely see Rudy

00:09:33.901 --> 00:09:35.601
confusing a mint
with technology.

00:09:35.601 --> 00:09:37.267
"I saw a video of poll workers

00:09:37.267 --> 00:09:39.000
passing around
fraudulent ballots.

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.601
It was on that
social-media site, Tic Tac.

00:09:41.601 --> 00:09:45.634
These guys...
[ Laughter ]

00:09:45.634 --> 00:09:47.367
...knew what they were doing
was illegal,

00:09:47.367 --> 00:09:50.434
and they knew they had no proof
for their wild, unhinged claims,

00:09:50.434 --> 00:09:52.501
but they harassed, bullied,

00:09:52.501 --> 00:09:54.834
pressured, and intimidated
people anyway.

00:09:54.834 --> 00:09:57.400
And they -- they came
very close to succeeding.

00:09:57.400 --> 00:09:58.834
It's very possible
the only thing

00:09:58.834 --> 00:10:01.067
that saved our democracy
from total collapse

00:10:01.067 --> 00:10:02.501
was the fact that Trump
was surrounded

00:10:02.501 --> 00:10:04.868
by absolute morons like Rudy,

00:10:04.868 --> 00:10:06.434
whose brain is the size of...

00:10:06.434 --> 00:10:07.734
-A ginger mint.

00:10:07.734 --> 00:10:17.634
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:10:17.634 --> 00:10:18.934
This has been "A Closer Look."

